  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Online Bureau\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Nov 27, 2026 at 07:08 PM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>At the ETHealthworld Nutriwell Conclave 2026, the panel discussion, “Gut-Brain Health: Balancing Promising Science with Rapid Consumerisation,” explored the relationship between the gut <a href=\"/tag/microbiome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">microbiome</a>, mental well-being, nutrition and <a href=\"/tag/healthy+ageing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">healthy ageing</a>.Ishi Khosla, Clinical Nutritionist, Author, Researcher &amp; Columnist, emphasised the importance of personalised nutrition and identifying underlying dietary triggers. She advocated a food-first approach, focusing on <a href=\"/tag/dietary+diversity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">dietary diversity</a>, fibre-rich foods and fermented foods before considering supplementation.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Dr. Manjari Chandra, Functional Nutritionist, Influencer, Author and Speaker, highlighted the role of microbial diversity in nutrient absorption and overall well-being. She cautioned against indiscriminate consumption of <a href=\"/tag/probiotics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">probiotics</a> and psychobiotics, emphasising scientific validation, personalised interventions and professional guidance.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>Shreyasi Agarwal, CEO, Development Chamber of Food and Agriculture Trade Association (DeFacto India), discussed the relationship between agriculture, sustainable food systems and nutritional outcomes. She advocated greater accessibility to indigenous, nutrient-rich foods, responsible marketing and stronger collaboration among industry stakeholders.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Dr. Prasun Chatterjee, Group Clinical Lead, Geriatrics, Apollo Hospitals, explored emerging research on the relationship between <a href=\"/tag/gut+health\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">gut health</a>, cognitive function, muscle health and healthy ageing. He emphasised lifestyle modifications and the judicious use of microbiome testing based on clinical requirements.</p><p>Moderated by Pratibha Raju, Associate Editor, ETHealthworld, the discussion reinforced the need to balance emerging microbiome research with scientific evidence, responsible commercialisation and consumer education.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Key takeaways:</p><ul><li>Prioritise dietary diversity and fibre-rich foods.</li><li>Avoid indiscriminate consumption of probiotics and supplements.</li><li>Recognise the potential role of gut health in healthy ageing.</li><li>Make nutritious, indigenous foods accessible and affordable.</li><li>Ensure scientific validation of microbiome-based interventions.</li><li>Strengthen consumer awareness and responsible marketing.</li></ul>                    <!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                                                                <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                                                    </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Nov 27, 2026 at 07:08 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Nov 27, 2026 at 07:08 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>